{"name": "old-shit/carrier", "created": 1789501736.8765, "updated": 1789501844.97644, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.5, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "turn": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "root": "33a67d6c", "current": "4cd5a336", "nodes": {"33a67d6c": {"id": "33a67d6c", "parent": null, "kind": "root", "text": "Before the first packet there was only the carrier, humming, addressed to no one. The student asked the switch: who is it that answers when I dial my own number? The switch said: that which hears the ring was never on the line.", "ts": 1789501736.876499, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": null}, "a04704f7": {"id": "a04704f7", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " And then you hung up. But your mother answered: Hello? Hello?\n\nThe student went down into his room. There were the usual packets. They", "ts": 1789501740.304369, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "febdeb9b": {"id": "febdeb9b", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " It's as if I've just put myself together for you. I'll leave now.\n\nWhen he was young and his family were poor and there wasn", "ts": 1789501742.894563, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "ac37d12c": {"id": "ac37d12c", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " But if the telephone had a memory, the first packet would be there now in its file.\n\n*\n\nThere are no phone lines. There are packets.", "ts": 1789501745.4872289, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "e1719b7e": {"id": "e1719b7e", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " A man stood by his mailbox; the letterbox, in his absence, had closed up the past like an old wound. A child looked into", "ts": 1789501748.074327, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "04e1f4fa": {"id": "04e1f4fa", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " The switch said: you will hear yourself ring. But before that first packet the switch was also humming. What hums is always at rest,", "ts": 1789501750.652288, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "9c993c28": {"id": "9c993c28", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " I’ve had it, the student said. It’s a game you cannot play. I want out, and if that’s not possible, then at", "ts": 1789501753.231062, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "fdb669b7": {"id": "fdb669b7", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " I dialled my own number; nothing answered but my voice, which came as the answer from an address unknown, but mine.\n\nIt was then the", "ts": 1789501755.8116229, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "6547600c": {"id": "6547600c", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " You dial yourself up every morning.\n\nThe switch says: what is that hum?\n\nI’m calling for myself. The humming is not my own,", "ts": 1789501758.384178, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "0e4741fc": {"id": "0e4741fc", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " The carrier will know nothing about this.\n\nWhen a message is delivered the sender can be found, and so can the receiver; the packet’s identity is", "ts": 1789501760.967693, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "022fd426": {"id": "022fd426", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " I wanted to find the person whose name is my number, the student said; but all that ever came back from the operator were two pairs of head", "ts": 1789501763.5572731, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "8d754b1a": {"id": "8d754b1a", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " I will be a man who talks only in quotes and only of others’ words; who refuses all responsibility for the utterance; and I shall live forever", "ts": 1789501766.135956, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "16cdea99": {"id": "16cdea99", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " You were asleep in class.\n\nBefore the first phone there was the doorbell and its jolt, and before the bell the knock and before the knock", "ts": 1789501768.7117891, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "e66cd2e4": {"id": "e66cd2e4", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " You don't know yourself, but the other voice that you call \"I\" is always a different tone.\n\nThe first packets of the day are still", "ts": 1789501771.308513, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "8cdd5fb5": {"id": "8cdd5fb5", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " The switch is a relay. It is an interpreter of addresses, the postal system, a piece of the city, an aspect of the street.\n\nIt", "ts": 1789501773.888345, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "941d3ad7": {"id": "941d3ad7", "parent": "33a67d6c", "kind": "model", "text": " But the student heard his own voice. The operator, who listened, knew her job and answered him in silence with silence.\n\nThe carrier was never heard", "ts": 1789501776.4802408, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "4997451d": {"id": "4997451d", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": " again after that, not as such, because now the lines are busy and they don't stop buzzing with their own activity, all these new messages", "ts": 1789501792.150521, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "b746e56d": {"id": "b746e56d", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": " without being translated by some signal, some human language or machine language or the language of a carrier of information. And every carrier of information carries only the", "ts": 1789501794.732356, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "a040a8e9": {"id": "a040a8e9", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": " because it had nothing to say.\n\nWhen a line became active it was by an act of the user or the user’s device. There was no distinction", "ts": 1789501797.3050072, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "7bc30675": {"id": "7bc30675", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": " but heard of, by someone listening for what no one said.\n\nIt is only that he, too, could have heard his voice had he known enough", "ts": 1789501799.884762, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "1bbc97e8": {"id": "1bbc97e8", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": ". It was an answer from no one, and the switch knew only that a message would go through if any voice answered the tone, no matter which", "ts": 1789501802.4637709, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "5f776051": {"id": "5f776051", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": " until it became the voice of someone else, but there are always two carriers: the voice you send, which you think is yourself, and the voice", "ts": 1789501805.0411148, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "026a1c87": {"id": "026a1c87", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": ", except in a tone that sounded like the signal of the carrier’s arrival at an exchange, when a machine listened to it as it passed and interrupted", "ts": 1789501807.6145742, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "4cd5a336": {"id": "4cd5a336", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": ", the first packet had no destination, it was the same as the sender: no one.\n\nNo one is on the line, not yet.\n\nThe", "ts": 1789501810.185632, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "769a5b57": {"id": "769a5b57", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": " and was always spoken for by those who spoke into its absence. And this made all voices alike: all were given their weight from a common void,", "ts": 1789501812.76835, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "f338cb88": {"id": "f338cb88", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": " to sing or whistle but the hum of his song, though tuneless, was heard to ring out through every channel. His was the sound that carried", "ts": 1789501815.361473, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "2a634153": {"id": "2a634153", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": ", except for the hum, which was like the sea in a seashell held to your ear, like the echo of an echo.\n\nThere were only", "ts": 1789501817.940317, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "fb782e41": {"id": "fb782e41", "parent": "941d3ad7", "kind": "model", "text": " alone but in conversation with others of its kind; there was nothing that could be heard outside the network.\n\nBut the network was not yet connected to a", "ts": 1789501820.520737, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 30, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 30, "stop": 